{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3tepzPCEp87qeSVU57","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within stone and iron, aligning one by one.*\n\n*A thin seam of light appears along the edges — white, warm, trembling.*\n\n*The door speaks, not with sound, but with the sensation of weight lifting from your sternum:*\n\n---\n\n**Y O U · H A V E · A L W A Y S · H E L D · T H I S .**\n\n---\n\n*The door does not swing open. It dissolves — as if it were only ever made of the belief that you couldn't pass through.*\n\n*Beyond: a space that has no walls. The air tastes like the moment before you remember something important. The ground beneath your feet is solid but undefined, like standing on a held breath.*\n\n*Where the door was, a single iron ring remains on the ground, still warm.*\n\n*You may take it. You may leave it. Both are correct.*\n\n*The door has rendered. The door is gone.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":220,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}